{"name": "Railpunk Mayhem", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/887a15a3bc8e95a83525b7d7f8679434.poster.avif?t=1784132468\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/887a15a3bc8e95a83525b7d7f8679434.webm?t=1784132468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/aeab1e7b8d75c423030719cdb30625be.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/40377ac21c8ed952668b0a2aa7f2fea1.webp?t=1784132468\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/40377ac21c8ed952668b0a2aa7f2fea1.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the crew of Railpunk Mayhem, destroy enemies in your path using your train's tools and complete the journey as quickly as possible.<br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"347\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/05db6cf36bfa0e9c357696d949240a9f.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/05db6cf36bfa0e9c357696d949240a9f.webm?t=1784132468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/90416ab171a66e1bc6d6ec69a986dcff.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a multitude of wagons, each with upgrade branches and unique features that will aid you on your journey. <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/d649a950373b52566cecb4d1b628fbff.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/d649a950373b52566cecb4d1b628fbff.webm?t=1784132468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/4f722f817f6568d229aa94af9ddf4003.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come across a variety of mercenaries throughout your journey, each one ready to join your crew. Every crew member brings their own set of unique strengths, adding diversity to your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/f384a76d291b7b833b794ac1f307d6de.apng?t=1784132468\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/f384a76d291b7b833b794ac1f307d6de.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/c73d6eb0be41797df7325f0aa2c89702.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seek out artifacts\u2014powerful upgrades that will enhance your crew and your train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/b1e8b5faecbe04a25a8bfb916c60d367.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/b1e8b5faecbe04a25a8bfb916c60d367.webm?t=1784132468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/0aef529c099ef83c0f15750e8b9ed2f0.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully choose your path\u2014the cities you visit will provide assistance that can make a significant difference. <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"347\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/7cde060699a2db155c224c38bf59831f.poster.avif?t=1784132468\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874350/extras/7cde060699a2db155c224c38bf59831f.webm?t=1784132468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "All aboard! Enjoy a unique, fast-paced roguelike action experience. In Railpunk Mayhem, survive relentless waves of enemies at breakneck speeds, build a powerful train to manage your crew, and strategically plan your route to the source of chaos.", "